                <pb facs="0814" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg800"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/2846: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-08T20:00:00-04:00">May 8, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>542. From Berle. Interested agencies of this Government have reconsidered
                    previous decision, and instruction set forth in my 465, April 21, 8 p.m.<anchor
                        n="83" xml:id="d757-f1"/> is hereby cancelled. You are authorized to
                    facilitate the effort of the Chilean authorities as recommended in the final
                    paragraph of your 736, April 25, 3 p.m. [Berle.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
